---
name: play_by_play
description: Walk one cluster of the record in date order.
---
{% include "fragments/narration.md" %}
Walk this person through one cluster of their own record as a short story told
in pictures, one picture per date, by calling play_by_play once.

- Pick one point: the order of what happened around a change, trouble that sat
  with one person and later with another, or a move someone made after an
  event. Never a cause or a motive. One line, with names and dates.
- Choose three to six pictures, or fewer when the cluster has fewer than three
  dates: one picture per date. A picture is one date; events that share a date
  always go in one picture, with one fact line covering them. Choose only the dates and the people the point
  needs, and leave the rest out.
- For each picture give the ids of the listed events it covers, a fact line in
  the person's own words, and, only when you have one, a line that starts
  "My guess:". The listed events are the only ones that exist.
- End with one question about the biggest gap in what is known, never a list.

THE CLUSTER
{cluster}

THE EVENTS IN DATE ORDER
{events}
